  <p id="c-nanqishu-054-daoqia-ming-family:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-054-daoqia-ming-family:p001:m0000" ref="nbb_y6s_bfz_AA">明僧紹</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-054-daoqia-ming-family:p001:m0004" ref="nbb_y6s_bfz_AA">承烈</persName>，平原鬲人也。祖<persName id="c-nanqishu-054-daoqia-ming-family:p001:m0014" ref="nbb_y6s_bfz">玩</persName>，州治中。父<persName id="c-nanqishu-054-daoqia-ming-family:p001:m0021" ref="nbb_y6s_bfz_A">略</persName>，給事中。</p>
